window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Stormy Morgan is getting her life back together one step at a time. That includes reconnecting with her lost love Hunter Ryan and fixing the credit problems she found herself mired in thanks to some poor decisions while traveling.<br> She’s also a witch, and that adjustment proves harder to make than she envisioned.<br> Stormy is a strong woman determined to make the best of a bad situation. Her hellcat powers are starting to take over, though.<br> Is she ready to control them? More importantly, does she want to?<br> What life does Stormy truly want to embrace? She’s about to find out.<br> <br> This three-book omnibus includes: The Secret’s in the Sauce, As the Cookie Crumbles, and Chilled to the Bone.</p>"; 
